                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 894.001Y8/28b.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 15, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Express to Japanese Government thanks for cordial treatment accorded to officers
                    and men of Asiatic fleet during recent visit.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
